1
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,400
Is something wrong, Jamie?

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,400
Jamie ate the look choup dessert!

3
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:09,760
How are you taking care of your brother?

4
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:11,200
Why did you let this happen?

5
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,720
It's all my fault.

6
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:14,440
I didn't take good care of Jamie.

7
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:17,200
Everyone is forbidden from entering that room.

8
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,200
It's my private office.

9
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:27,880
I've waited to be with you in this room for so long.

10
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:30,480
Welcome to your world, Jane.

11
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:32,680
Have you still not forgotten?

12
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:35,480
I will never forget.

13
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Let's get back together, P'Jane.

14
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:03,440
I am so happy,

15
00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:06,400
that we got to meet each other again.

16
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,880
For the past five years,

17
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,520
I missed you so much, P'Jane.

18
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:25,240
I thought I would never get to see you again.

19
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:30,480
Thank you

20
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:34,520
for coming back into my life, Jane.

21
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:42,720
Thank you for not giving up on someone like me.

22
00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:01,160
But I haven't finished sculpting it yet,

23
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:03,680
and you came in and saw it first.

24
00:02:09,160 --> 00:02:11,039
Actually, this room...

25
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:16,560
I used it to come in and reminisce about my memories

26
00:02:17,600 --> 00:02:19,240
during the time I didn't have you.

27
00:02:20,079 --> 00:02:22,240
It helped ease my loneliness a little.

28
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:27,640
From now on,

29
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:29,400
you don't have to be lonely anymore, P'Jane,

30
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:34,520
because the real Jane is right here now.

31
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:49,480
Huh?

32
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:27,400
After this,

33
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:31,200
I won't let you take it off ever again.

34
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:41,079
Thank you.

35
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:26,000
What did P'Ram say

36
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,840
about when Jamie can come home?

37
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:30,040
P'Ram said

38
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:32,120
he wants to do another physical checkup

39
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:33,680
tomorrow morning.

40
00:04:35,440 --> 00:04:36,600
If nothing is wrong,

41
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:38,600
he should be able to come back

42
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:40,600
and rest at home tomorrow.

43
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:45,960
And...

44
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,640
what about your dad, P'Jane?

45
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:51,080
Is he still angry?

46
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:55,240
Dad and I have always been like this.

47
00:04:57,760 --> 00:04:59,200
It's not your fault, Jane.

48
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:09,880
For him,

49
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:13,760
everything is an investment,

50
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:18,600
even with family or his own children.

51
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,400
But today, he seemed to love

52
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:32,240
and worry about Jamie a lot.

53
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,280
That isn't love.

54
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:39,520
A parent's love

55
00:05:39,520 --> 00:05:41,720
doesn't ask for anything in return.

56
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:42,600
He's just afraid

57
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:44,159
that everything he invested in Jamie

58
00:05:44,159 --> 00:05:45,640
would go to waste.

59
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:51,320
Even though Dad acts like he loves Jamie a lot,

60
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:54,600
he never makes time for him.

61
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:01,040
As for his American mom,

62
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:04,560
once she dropped Jamie off,

63
00:06:06,520 --> 00:06:08,640
she disappeared and never came back.

64
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:12,800
Please...

65
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:15,840
don't leave me

66
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:18,560
like my mom did...

67
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:25,000
I want to raise Jamie the best I can.

68
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:28,720
I don't want him to feel

69
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:30,600
like he's missing anything.

70
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:36,360
And I don't want him to grow up

71
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:38,600
to become a person like my dad.

72
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,400
P'Jane...

73
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:55,600
I promise

74
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:59,960
that I will help take care of Jamie

75
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:04,360
and stay right by your side like this.

76
00:07:05,200 --> 00:07:07,000
You're not on your own anymore, P'Jane.

77
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:58,560
You walk in with a warning sign

78
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:06,000
Just one look and already falling for you

79
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:13,120
My friends tell me not to cross that line

80
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:20,400
But I’m already out of time

81
00:08:22,400 --> 00:08:24,480
I know the truth, I taste the sin

82
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:26,080
It’s wrong but I don’t want it to be true

83
00:08:26,080 --> 00:08:28,600
I’m losing all my discipline

84
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:32,760
You’re all I’m thinking of

85
00:08:32,760 --> 00:08:34,840
and I’m breaking all the rules

86
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:37,120
just because…

87
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:40,520
You’re a red flag but I’m colorblind

88
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:43,919
I know you’re dangerous

89
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:47,720
If it burns, let it burn me alive

90
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:52,040
I can't hold myself back, I’d cross every line

91
00:08:57,680 --> 00:09:00,320
Ooh

92
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:10,680
(Thanapat Piboonosot)

93
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:21,280
Oh,

94
00:09:25,760 --> 00:09:26,320
Dad.

95
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:31,600
Hello, Uncle, Auntie.

96
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:32,280
Hello.

97
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:33,240
Hello!

98
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:36,440
How are you doing, Jane?

99
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:38,720
It's been so long since we last met.

100
00:09:41,280 --> 00:09:43,120
You arrived just in time.

101
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:44,480
Let's eat together.

102
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:46,080
We made a whole lot of food.

103
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,520
Thank you.

104
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:04,280
Thank you so much for taking care of Jane.

105
00:10:04,800 --> 00:10:06,720
When I heard that Jane applied

106
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:08,760
for a job at that company,

107
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:11,360
and then found out later that

108
00:10:11,520 --> 00:10:12,840
it was your company,

109
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:14,480
I was so shocked!

110
00:10:16,040 --> 00:10:17,200
But I feel at ease

111
00:10:17,880 --> 00:10:18,920
knowing you are his boss.

112
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:20,400
It's no trouble at all.

113
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,160
I naturally have to

114
00:10:22,160 --> 00:10:23,760
take extra special care of Jane anyway.

115
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,240
Wait...

116
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:30,800
Did Jane and Big Jane

117
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:33,000
get back together?

118
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:33,960
Hmm?

119
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:37,000
Ooh!

120
00:10:40,400 --> 00:10:40,880
Yes, we did.

121
00:10:40,880 --> 00:10:41,520
Ooh!

122
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:52,000
Either way, I have to thank you, Big Jane,

123
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:53,640
for taking care of Jane.

124
00:10:54,520 --> 00:10:55,840
If you ever need anything,

125
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,320
just let me know, okay?

126
00:10:58,800 --> 00:10:59,760
With pleasure.

127
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,440
And

128
00:11:01,920 --> 00:11:03,680
if anyone here needs help with anything...

129
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:04,480
Oh,

130
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:05,680
I'm more than happy to give my full support.

131
00:11:06,520 --> 00:11:07,880
Jane's family

132
00:11:08,400 --> 00:11:09,960
is just like my family.

133
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:19,440
Thank you so much, really.

134
00:11:19,760 --> 00:11:21,720
But right now, our family

135
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:23,000
doesn't need anything

136
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:25,040
and isn't in any trouble.

137
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:28,560
Just you hiring Jane to work for you...

138
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:31,240
has already helped us greatly.

139
00:11:32,640 --> 00:11:33,440
Yes.

140
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:38,080
Ah.

141
00:11:38,880 --> 00:11:40,760
Here, have two shrimps.

142
00:12:25,760 --> 00:12:27,080
The room is a bit small.

143
00:12:28,640 --> 00:12:30,360
It can't compare to your place, P'Jane.

144
00:12:38,280 --> 00:12:39,920
Since I stepped into your house,

145
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:43,240
I haven't seen a single drawing of yours yet.

146
00:12:43,640 --> 00:12:45,280
Have you really given up on drawing?

147
00:12:49,720 --> 00:12:52,280
I gave up on your dream of becoming an artist...

148
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:01,720
Was it because of what happened back then?

149
00:13:07,400 --> 00:13:08,240
That day, I thought

150
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:09,640
about submitting it to a competition,

151
00:13:10,400 --> 00:13:11,880
but after what happened...

152
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:21,480
I'm sorry.

153
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:27,720
Is it because you're the big brother

154
00:13:28,680 --> 00:13:30,280
that you had to sacrifice that much?

155
00:13:34,800 --> 00:13:36,240
I've made up my mind

156
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:39,960
that I'll take care of my family the best I can.

157
00:13:43,280 --> 00:13:44,720
If everyone is happy,

158
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:46,840
I'm happy too.

159
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:54,240
You'd be surprised

160
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:56,480
if you knew how many people

161
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:58,440
have asked me for favors regarding their dreams.

162
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,400
I don't know either,

163
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:10,760
I can't even imagine

164
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:12,560
what kind of person

165
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:14,600
would ask for a favor regarding their dreams.

166
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:16,760
Because achieving your dream

167
00:14:16,760 --> 00:14:18,560
by your own efforts...

168
00:14:18,560 --> 00:14:19,720
isn't that what makes a dream valuable

169
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:21,040
in the first place?

170
00:14:25,680 --> 00:14:27,320
People who think like you...

171
00:14:27,920 --> 00:14:29,720
there probably aren't many of them around.

172
00:14:32,880 --> 00:14:33,600
Is that so?

173
00:14:37,880 --> 00:14:39,520
And is granting favors

174
00:14:39,520 --> 00:14:41,200
your dream?

175
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:54,640
Regardless of whether granting favors

176
00:14:54,640 --> 00:14:56,840
is your dream or not,

177
00:14:58,200 --> 00:14:59,880
I'll stay right here.

178
00:15:05,160 --> 00:15:06,560
Whatever you do,

179
00:15:07,640 --> 00:15:09,680
I believe in your decision.

180
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:14,640
Are you drawing me?

181
00:16:18,040 --> 00:16:18,840
I'm not telling.

182
00:16:24,920 --> 00:16:26,040
Let me take a look.

183
00:16:27,200 --> 00:16:28,000
No way!

184
00:16:30,600 --> 00:16:31,400
P'Jane!

185
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:33,400
I said no!

186
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:34,080
P'Jane!

187
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:34,960
P'Jane!

188
00:16:35,040 --> 00:16:35,520
Ouch!

189
00:16:51,040 --> 00:16:52,000
P'Jane!

190
00:16:52,920 --> 00:16:53,880
What are you doing?

191
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:00,240
P'Jane!

192
00:17:01,240 --> 00:17:02,600
What are you doing?

193
00:17:05,280 --> 00:17:05,760
Hey!

194
00:17:16,079 --> 00:17:16,920
JP!

195
00:17:17,839 --> 00:17:18,680
P'Jane!

196
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:22,520
Jamie!

197
00:17:30,080 --> 00:17:31,480
What do we do now?

198
00:18:00,200 --> 00:18:01,000
Jamie,

199
00:18:03,080 --> 00:18:03,800
listen...

200
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:05,960
there's something I need to tell you.

201
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:09,400
It's...

202
00:18:09,400 --> 00:18:10,200
JP

203
00:18:10,400 --> 00:18:11,800
and Lil' Jane

204
00:18:12,240 --> 00:18:13,640
are dating, right?

205
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:22,800
Yeah.

206
00:18:23,320 --> 00:18:24,600
I already knew.

207
00:18:25,360 --> 00:18:27,640
JP is so close to Lil' Jane,

208
00:18:27,760 --> 00:18:29,200
like attached at the hip all the time.

209
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:30,280
Plus,

210
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:33,800
you keep sneaking glances at each other.

211
00:18:36,600 --> 00:18:38,000
You already knew?

212
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:39,080
Mm.

213
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:41,000
It's not just me.

214
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:42,040
Auntie May

215
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:43,960
and everyone else in the house...

216
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:45,680
it seems like they all know too.

217
00:18:51,320 --> 00:18:53,000
But I won't allow it!

218
00:18:53,800 --> 00:18:54,480
JP!

219
00:18:54,800 --> 00:18:56,600
Don't steal Lil' Jane away from me!

220
00:18:57,840 --> 00:18:59,440
Jamie, what are you doing?

221
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:00,960
Get up!

222
00:19:02,400 --> 00:19:03,600
Jamie, what are you doing?

223
00:19:03,600 --> 00:19:04,440
Hm, you little rascal!

224
00:19:04,440 --> 00:19:05,440
Gently...

225
00:19:06,080 --> 00:19:06,960
What is this?!

226
00:19:07,400 --> 00:19:08,160
Don't come near me!

227
00:19:08,560 --> 00:19:09,160
Aah!

228
00:19:09,720 --> 00:19:10,720
Don't come close!

229
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:11,880
Hey! Hey!

230
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:12,360
Whoa!

231
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:13,880
Jamie, get him!

232
00:19:13,880 --> 00:19:15,320
Ouch! Go! Run away!

233
00:19:15,320 --> 00:19:15,920
Ah!

234
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:16,600
Go, go!

235
00:19:16,600 --> 00:19:17,160
Not that way!

236
00:19:17,160 --> 00:19:18,240
Go to the back!

237
00:19:40,280 --> 00:19:41,880
Hello, Jean? What's up?

238
00:19:43,120 --> 00:19:43,680
Hey!

239
00:19:43,880 --> 00:19:44,800
Are you serious?!

240
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:54,080
What do you think?

241
00:20:25,280 --> 00:20:27,040
And now, the crucial moment has arrived!

242
00:20:27,640 --> 00:20:29,520
Contestants, please get ready!

243
00:20:29,840 --> 00:20:31,320
And the final contestant

244
00:20:31,320 --> 00:20:32,640
to make it through to the next round...

245
00:20:33,400 --> 00:20:34,680
Mr.Jetnarin,

246
00:20:34,680 --> 00:20:37,720
number zero-six-seven!

247
00:20:39,480 --> 00:20:40,200
Yes!

248
00:20:40,200 --> 00:20:40,880
I made it, man!

249
00:20:41,160 --> 00:20:41,840
Woohoo!

250
00:20:42,520 --> 00:20:43,360
Awesome, man!

251
00:20:43,360 --> 00:20:43,960
Awesome, awesome!

252
00:20:44,120 --> 00:20:44,920
You did great, man!

253
00:20:44,920 --> 00:20:45,680
Awesome!

254
00:20:45,680 --> 00:20:46,560
You did great!

255
00:20:48,160 --> 00:20:49,800
Let's take a group photo!

256
00:21:12,280 --> 00:21:13,280
Thank you.

257
00:21:13,280 --> 00:21:14,080
How was it?

258
00:21:14,080 --> 00:21:15,120
See you next time!

259
00:21:16,080 --> 00:21:17,080
Woohoo!

260
00:21:24,480 --> 00:21:25,480
Did you come from far away?

261
00:21:25,480 --> 00:21:26,720
A bit far, yeah!

262
00:21:27,720 --> 00:21:29,280
Can I tell a little joke?

263
00:21:29,280 --> 00:21:29,800
Sure thing.

264
00:21:29,800 --> 00:21:31,240
What was your name again?

265
00:21:31,240 --> 00:21:32,480
My name is Jet.

266
00:21:32,640 --> 00:21:33,120
Huh?

267
00:21:33,120 --> 00:21:34,600
I thought your name was 'My Love'?

268
00:21:34,600 --> 00:21:35,400
Oh?

269
00:21:35,920 --> 00:21:37,240
And I thought your name was 'My Love'?

270
00:21:37,240 --> 00:21:38,200
Eek!

271
00:21:38,200 --> 00:21:38,720
Yeah.

272
00:21:38,720 --> 00:21:39,920
I came from really far away!

273
00:21:39,920 --> 00:21:40,440
Whoa,

274
00:21:40,440 --> 00:21:41,280
thank you so much!

275
00:21:41,280 --> 00:21:42,520
I've been following you for a very long time.

276
00:21:42,520 --> 00:21:44,200
I went to see a doctor yesterday too.

277
00:21:44,200 --> 00:21:45,840
The doctor said I have heart disease.

278
00:21:45,840 --> 00:21:46,320
Huh?

279
00:21:46,680 --> 00:21:47,760
Oh, why heart disease?

280
00:21:47,760 --> 00:21:48,800
Well, I think my heart's gone missing

281
00:21:48,800 --> 00:21:50,080
and it's with you!

282
00:21:50,080 --> 00:21:52,160
Hmm, I'm searching for my heart too!

283
00:22:02,520 --> 00:22:04,040
Come here!

284
00:22:07,400 --> 00:22:08,320
Mom, what are you doing?

285
00:22:08,720 --> 00:22:09,760
I'm taking pictures

286
00:22:09,760 --> 00:22:11,800
to show off to my friends, of course!

287
00:22:11,800 --> 00:22:13,760
Jet is an idol now!

288
00:22:13,760 --> 00:22:14,800
Hmm.

289
00:22:14,800 --> 00:22:16,520
Jet really is capable, isn't he?

290
00:22:16,520 --> 00:22:17,160
Yeah.

291
00:22:17,400 --> 00:22:19,560
He failed auditions so many times,

292
00:22:19,560 --> 00:22:20,400
but he never backed down

293
