460
00:33:16,040 --> 00:33:17,160
Lastly,

461
00:33:24,360 --> 00:33:25,720
I would like to apologize to all the fans

462
00:33:25,720 --> 00:33:26,960
who have followed me,

463
00:33:30,840 --> 00:33:32,520
as well as to my family.

464
00:33:34,040 --> 00:33:35,120
Alright, viewers,

465
00:33:35,120 --> 00:33:37,120
and that is Jet's response.

466
00:33:37,200 --> 00:33:38,120
In any case,

467
00:33:38,560 --> 00:33:39,920
to all the fans out there,

468
00:33:40,240 --> 00:33:42,160
