that I'm your younger sister!

498
00:34:44,480 --> 00:34:46,719
Can everyone stop talking like it's all my fault?!

499
00:34:46,719 --> 00:34:48,239
And isn't it?!

500
00:34:48,239 --> 00:34:49,440
Everything that happened

501
00:34:49,440 --> 00:34:50,360
