580
00:39:26,560 --> 00:39:28,760
Mom and dad forced you too!

581
00:39:32,000 --> 00:39:32,800
That's right!

582
00:39:33,720 --> 00:39:35,080
It's because you're a loser!

583
00:39:36,560 --> 00:39:38,680
But I refuse to be a loser like you!

584
00:39:39,280 --> 00:39:40,880
Why are you attacking him?!

585
00:39:40,880 --> 00:39:42,600
He's the one who's been helping us out!

586
00:39:42,600 --> 00:39:44,560
You're the only one constantly causing trouble!

587
00:39:44,560 --> 00:39:46,080
What about the football gambling incident?!

588
00:39:48,000 --> 00:39:49,000
Football gambling?!

589
00:39:53,120 --> 00:39:53,640
What?

590
00:39:53,640 --> 00:39:54,960
What football gambling, Jean?

591
00:39:55,800 --> 00:39:56,280
Well,

592
00:39:56,520 --> 00:39:57,680
back in high school,

593
00:39:58,080 --> 00:39:58,920
Jet

594
00:39:58,920 --> 00:40:00,400
got into football gambling debt,

595
00:40:00,400 --> 00:40:02,200
and Jane had to keep helping him out.

596
00:40:05,240 --> 00:40:05,760
Jet...

597
00:40:07,320 --> 00:40:09,320
Jet, why did you get into football gambling, son?

598
00:40:10,280 --> 00:40:11,000
Why did you get involved in

599
00:40:11,000 --> 00:40:11,800
football gambling like that?

600
00:40:11,800 --> 00:40:14,280
Because I wanted to be independent from you!

601
00:40:19,280 --> 00:40:21,280
You have never understood us!

602
00:40:24,760 --> 00:40:25,760
Never gave us the chance

603
00:40:25,760 --> 00:40:27,440
to choose our own lives!

604
00:40:27,800 --> 00:40:28,600
Jet!

605
00:40:32,280 --> 00:40:32,880
Mom!

606
00:40:39,000 --> 00:40:41,360
I'll pay the ten million baht in damages for Jet myself.

607
00:40:42,360 --> 00:40:43,000
No.

608
00:40:44,800 --> 00:40:46,200
P'Jane, don't do this.

609
00:40:47,440 --> 00:40:49,600
How many more times do you have to keep helping Jet?!

610
00:40:53,120 --> 00:40:54,600
Then I won't help for free.

611
00:41:04,560 --> 00:41:05,800
I'll buy this house,

612
00:41:06,440 --> 00:41:07,880
along with the pharmacy,

613
00:41:09,080 --> 00:41:10,480
for the price of ten million baht.

614
00:41:16,440 --> 00:41:17,680
Is everyone okay with this?

615
00:41:18,320 --> 00:41:19,120
This house...

616
00:41:21,800 --> 00:41:23,200
the pharmacy that...

617
00:41:23,520 --> 00:41:25,280
my father built with his own hands...

618
00:41:34,360 --> 00:41:35,920
P'Jane, please go back first.

619
00:41:38,840 --> 00:41:39,760
Please give our family some time

620
00:41:39,760 --> 00:41:40,920
to talk things through.

621
00:42:14,960 --> 00:42:15,680
Jane,

622
00:42:18,160 --> 00:42:19,480
how are things at home?

623
00:42:28,680 --> 00:42:30,000
Today at 10:30 AM,

624
00:42:30,200 --> 00:42:31,960
there's a pitch project meeting from Vietnam.

625
00:42:32,960 --> 00:42:34,320
The afternoon is still open..

626
00:42:35,400 --> 00:42:37,640
would you like me to schedule anything for you?

627
00:42:41,520 --> 00:42:42,320
It's alright.

628
00:42:43,920 --> 00:42:45,360
That'll be all for today, Jane.

629
00:42:48,280 --> 00:42:49,080
Understood.

630
00:42:50,440 --> 00:42:51,160
Jane.

631
00:42:53,600 --> 00:42:54,160
Yes?

632
00:43:06,240 --> 00:43:07,880
Your face looks quite pale.

633
00:43:12,640 --> 00:43:13,760
Are you feeling unwell?

634
00:43:16,320 --> 00:43:17,120
No.

635
00:43:18,640 --> 00:43:19,600
I'm fine.

636
00:43:22,880 --> 00:43:23,680
Are you tired?

637
00:43:25,920 --> 00:43:27,280
You can take a break for today.

638
00:43:28,400 --> 00:43:30,320
I'll go pick up Jamie myself after work.

639
00:43:34,920 --> 00:43:35,840
It's okay.

640
00:43:37,920 --> 00:43:38,720
I can do it.

641
00:43:43,200 --> 00:43:44,440
About Jet's damage fee,

642
00:43:44,640 --> 00:43:45,200
let me...

643
00:43:45,200 --> 00:43:46,000
It's alright.

644
00:43:49,040 --> 00:43:50,440
You've already helped so much, P'Jane.

645
00:43:55,000 --> 00:43:55,880
I'm sorry.

646
00:43:58,360 --> 00:43:59,720
Are you still angry with me, Jane?

647
00:44:02,920 --> 00:44:03,720
No, I'm not.

648
00:44:15,400 --> 00:44:17,080
P'Jane, I have work to do.

649
00:44:18,880 --> 00:44:19,800
What work?

650
00:44:21,760 --> 00:44:23,120
Your boss is right here.

651
00:44:46,800 --> 00:44:47,680
P'Jane, let go.

652
00:44:49,240 --> 00:44:50,600
Someone might see us.

653
00:44:52,720 --> 00:44:53,520
I won't let go

654
00:44:56,240 --> 00:44:57,880
until you stop sulking at me.

655
00:45:02,760 --> 00:45:04,160
I said I'm not sulking.

656
00:45:19,760 --> 00:45:21,680
Then can I hold you like this?

657
00:46:05,440 --> 00:46:08,600
(Thanapat Piboonosot)

658
00:46:08,600 --> 00:46:14,080
(Vibe Wave Agency)

659
00:46:14,080 --> 00:46:16,080
How are we going to settle this ten million baht, Jet?

660
00:46:16,840 --> 00:46:18,200
Please give me some time.

661
00:46:21,600 --> 00:46:23,120
I'll hurry and find a way to pay it back.

662
00:46:24,080 --> 00:46:26,800
The agency took a heavy hit as well, Jet.

663
00:46:26,800 --> 00:46:28,160
The sponsors have already filed claims

664
00:46:28,160 --> 00:46:29,520
for breach of contract.

665
00:46:29,520 --> 00:46:31,200
It's no small amount of money.

666
00:46:31,200 --> 00:46:32,560
If you can't come up with it,

667
00:46:32,560 --> 00:46:34,200
I'll have no choice but to sue.

668
00:46:34,560 --> 00:46:35,480
Uh...

669
00:46:37,680 --> 00:46:39,960
we're truly sorry.

670
00:46:40,440 --> 00:46:42,200
Please don't sue Jet.

671
00:46:42,560 --> 00:46:44,320
It's such a large sum of money...

672
00:46:44,880 --> 00:46:46,640
could you please give us a little more time?

673
00:46:47,120 --> 00:46:49,160
Perhaps if you had raised your child properly

674
00:46:49,160 --> 00:46:50,480
so he wouldn't cause trouble,

675
00:46:50,480 --> 00:46:53,480
we wouldn't have had this problem in the first place.

676
00:46:53,960 --> 00:46:55,000
Either way, just make sure you find the money

677
00:46:55,000 --> 00:46:56,040
in time.

678
00:46:56,840 --> 00:46:58,440
Otherwise, you can expect a court summons.

679
00:46:59,080 --> 00:47:00,200
Hey, why are you talking like that?!

680
00:47:00,200 --> 00:47:01,640
I'll go on live stream and expose everything!

681
00:47:02,240 --> 00:47:03,040
Jean!

682
00:47:03,480 --> 00:47:04,840
Fine by me, go ahead and try.

683
00:47:05,280 --> 00:47:06,480
Let's see who the public will believe.

684
00:47:12,200 --> 00:47:13,440
Calm down, Jean.

685
00:47:14,400 --> 00:47:16,440
Things will only get more complicated.

686
00:47:25,240 --> 00:47:25,920
I'll...

687
00:47:26,240 --> 00:47:27,480
I'll try seeing if I

688
00:47:28,240 --> 00:47:30,160
can borrow money from anyone I know.

689
00:47:32,360 --> 00:47:33,760
But if that really doesn't work out,

690
00:47:35,400 --> 00:47:37,480
I'll try looking into loan sharks

691
00:47:38,400 --> 00:47:39,840
and pay it back bit by bit.

692
00:47:41,600 --> 00:47:42,560
No way, no way!

693
00:47:42,800 --> 00:47:43,880
I won't let you, Jane!

694
00:47:45,600 --> 00:47:47,680
I won't let you take out from loan sharks!

695
00:47:47,880 --> 00:47:50,120
Even if your salary is enough to make the payments,

696
00:47:50,600 --> 00:47:52,680
they'll still find a way to take advantage of you!

697
00:47:52,680 --> 00:47:53,400
I won't allow it!

698
00:47:53,400 --> 00:47:55,040
I won't let you take out a loan!

699
00:47:55,680 --> 00:47:56,680
No, Jane!

700
00:47:58,600 --> 00:47:59,600
Absolutely not!

701
00:48:00,000 --> 00:48:01,080
It's okay.

702
00:48:03,040 --> 00:48:03,840
I can handle it.

703
00:48:08,120 --> 00:48:09,240
I'm so sorry...

704
00:48:12,000 --> 00:48:13,440
Why are you apologizing?

705
00:48:15,680 --> 00:48:17,800
Everything I'm doing, I do willingly.

706
00:48:20,280 --> 00:48:22,200
Even though I don't want to go to prison,

707
00:48:23,480 --> 00:48:25,400
if it keeps everyone from suffering,

708
00:48:28,440 --> 00:48:29,480
I will accept it.

709
00:48:36,560 --> 00:48:37,480
Dad..

710
00:48:38,640 --> 00:48:39,880
I am truly sorry

711
00:48:40,960 --> 00:48:43,640
that I couldn't keep this shop...

712
00:48:49,120 --> 00:48:49,920
Jane,

713
00:48:51,600 --> 00:48:53,120
you don't have to go borrow money from anyone.

714
00:48:55,280 --> 00:48:57,040
Go ahead and sell my shop.

715
00:48:58,720 --> 00:48:59,640
I give in.

716
00:49:00,760 --> 00:49:01,680
Dad..

717
00:49:03,920 --> 00:49:04,840
Dad..

718
00:49:13,800 --> 00:49:14,880
Just let it go.

719
00:49:50,640 --> 00:49:51,480
Hello?

720
00:49:51,960 --> 00:49:53,120
Hello, is this Mr.Jennalee?

721
00:49:54,800 --> 00:49:56,280
Yes, speaking.

722
00:49:56,800 --> 00:49:57,960
We have appraised your property.

723
00:50:01,880 --> 00:50:03,080
Including the house, the pharmacy, and the land,

724
00:50:04,680 --> 00:50:05,880
it comes out to about five million baht.

725
00:50:08,120 --> 00:50:08,880
Oh...

726
00:50:09,840 --> 00:50:10,320
I see.

727
00:50:11,120 --> 00:50:14,880
If you are interested, please contact us back.

728
00:50:17,360 --> 00:50:18,680
Yes, thank you.

729
00:50:22,920 --> 00:50:24,640
What did the bank say?

730
00:50:30,760 --> 00:50:31,840
The bank said

731
00:50:34,280 --> 00:50:36,280
our house's appraised value is five million baht.

732
00:50:40,280 --> 00:50:42,280
If we use the house as collateral for a loan,

733
00:50:43,120 --> 00:50:44,440
we'd likely get even less than that.

734
00:50:45,120 --> 00:50:46,640
Why is it so low?

735
00:50:46,920 --> 00:50:47,960
The amount P'Jane offered

736
00:50:47,960 --> 00:50:49,680
was ten million!

737
00:50:52,720 --> 00:50:55,560
P'Jane was just trying to help us in his own way.

738
00:50:57,120 --> 00:50:59,120
Then what are we going to do?

739
00:50:59,720 --> 00:51:03,000
Mom and dad said to sell off everything we have,

740
00:51:03,000 --> 00:51:04,360
but from the looks of it...

741
00:51:04,360 --> 00:51:05,800
we won't even reach one million.

742
00:51:16,440 --> 00:51:17,120
Jane!

743
00:51:17,800 --> 00:51:19,080
Hello, P'Dan.

744
00:51:20,400 --> 00:51:21,400
How are things with Jet?

745
00:51:21,840 --> 00:51:22,680
Is there anything I can help with?

746
00:51:23,040 --> 00:51:23,600
Well...

747
00:51:24,000 --> 00:51:25,400
it's about the ten million baht.

748
00:51:29,080 --> 00:51:29,840
Jean,

749
00:51:30,640 --> 00:51:31,640
go upstairs first.

750
00:51:43,160 --> 00:51:43,720
Jane,

751
00:51:44,720 --> 00:51:45,720
don't worry.

752
00:51:46,640 --> 00:51:48,240
I'll find a way to help.

753
00:51:48,600 --> 00:51:51,720
I happen to know several senior investors.

754
00:51:52,240 --> 00:51:52,880
I'll try asking

755
00:51:52,880 --> 00:51:54,160
to borrow the money from them for you.

756
00:51:55,280 --> 00:51:56,440
You can't do that, P'Dan.

757
00:51:57,200 --> 00:51:58,480
Ten million baht...

758
00:51:59,600 --> 00:52:01,160
why should you take on a debt like that for us?

759
00:52:01,640 --> 00:52:02,400
It's fine.

760
00:52:03,040 --> 00:52:04,040
I want to help.

761
00:52:09,400 --> 00:52:10,400
Please don't.

762
00:52:12,000 --> 00:52:12,800
It's not right.

763
00:52:13,680 --> 00:52:14,560
Thank you, though.

764
00:52:18,520 --> 00:52:19,320
Jane.

765
00:52:25,320 --> 00:52:27,080
You still have the nerve to step foot here?

766
00:52:27,960 --> 00:52:29,720
Haven't you caused their family enough trouble already?

767
00:52:30,600 --> 00:52:31,880
Why can't I be here?

768
00:52:35,160 --> 00:52:36,520
Jane is my boyfriend.

769
00:52:40,800 --> 00:52:41,680
What about you?

770
00:52:42,200 --> 00:52:43,320
What does this have to do with you?

771
00:52:45,880 --> 00:52:47,200
Why are you sticking your nose in?

772
00:52:49,720 --> 00:52:51,680
Can you both please calm down first?

773
00:53:00,000 --> 00:53:01,480
P'Dan, please go back for now.

774
00:53:05,680 --> 00:53:07,600
I have an important matter to discuss with P'Jane.

775
00:53:11,280 --> 00:53:13,000
You're still going to let him help you?

776
00:53:13,480 --> 00:53:14,400
Have you forgotten

777
00:53:16,000 --> 00:53:17,880
how much hardship he caused you?

778
00:53:22,320 --> 00:53:23,280
Please go back first.

779
00:53:28,720 --> 00:53:29,600
Please.

780
00:54:00,320 --> 00:54:02,480
I've talked with my family about the house.

781
00:54:29,000 --> 00:54:30,200
We've decided

782
00:54:32,080 --> 00:54:34,320
that we will sell the house and the shop to you.

783
00:54:39,880 --> 00:54:40,680
Alright.

784
00:54:42,000 --> 00:54:43,720
I'll transfer the money over right now

785
00:54:46,560 --> 00:54:48,680
so you can hurry and pay Jet's agency.

786
00:54:57,400 --> 00:54:58,280
And I'll have someone prepare

787
00:54:58,280 --> 00:55:00,240
the purchase documents later.

788
00:55:07,880 --> 00:55:08,680
Thank you.

789
00:55:19,800 --> 00:55:21,200
However, you and your family...

790
00:55:24,080 --> 00:55:25,560
(Thanapat Piboonosot)

791
00:55:25,560 --> 00:55:27,240
...can still continue living in this house.

792
00:55:28,560 --> 00:55:30,160
I've already spoken with my parents.

793
00:55:34,600 --> 00:55:35,760
You've already helped us

794
00:55:35,760 --> 00:55:37,360
more than enough, P'Jane.

795
00:55:39,240 --> 00:55:40,880
We have no face left to stay here.

796
00:55:46,880 --> 00:55:47,760
But..

797
00:55:49,680 --> 00:55:51,040
I still want to help.

798
00:55:51,600 --> 00:55:53,320
Let's leave it at that.

799
00:57:00,400 --> 00:57:01,640
Watch your step.

800
00:57:20,680 --> 00:57:22,880
Is this all we have left now?

801
00:57:23,960 --> 00:57:26,240
Give it time, we'll get used to it.

802
00:57:26,240 --> 00:57:27,360
When we were young,

803
00:57:27,360 --> 00:57:29,480
we went through much tougher times than this.

804
00:57:31,320 --> 00:57:32,200
If we fight through this one more time,

805
00:57:32,200 --> 00:57:33,880
we'll be just fine.

806
00:57:35,400 --> 00:57:36,480
Yeah.

807
00:57:41,880 --> 00:57:44,120
Once I get the money from my next live stream,

808
00:57:44,120 --> 00:57:46,240
I'll go buy more things to add to the place.

809
00:57:46,240 --> 00:57:47,800
So you won't have to suffer as much.

810
00:57:53,200 --> 00:57:54,280
Mom...

811
00:57:55,120 --> 00:57:56,400
it's okay.

812
00:58:02,240 --> 00:58:04,560
We will get through this together, everyone.

813
00:58:06,640 --> 00:58:08,360
It's fine, just hang in there a bit longer.

814
00:58:34,800 --> 00:58:35,640
Thank you.

815
00:58:35,960 --> 00:58:36,760
Yes.

816
00:58:38,680 --> 00:58:39,760
Um...

817
00:58:40,280 --> 00:58:42,040
You look really familiar.

818
00:58:44,480 --> 00:58:45,560
You've got the wrong person.

819
00:58:45,880 --> 00:58:46,600
Ah, alright.

820
00:59:34,040 --> 00:59:34,600
Are you really going back to sleep

821
00:59:34,600 --> 00:59:36,240
at your parents' place, Jane?

822
00:59:40,760 --> 00:59:41,600
Yes.

823
00:59:42,880 --> 00:59:44,160
I've made up my mind that

824
00:59:44,640 --> 00:59:46,520
I'll go back to take care of my family.

825
00:59:49,680 --> 00:59:51,800
But regarding Jamie, you don't have to worry.

826
00:59:52,200 --> 00:59:53,840
I'll still keep working as usual.

827
00:59:56,800 --> 00:59:57,480
Because you need to earn money

828
00:59:57,480 --> 00:59:58,760
to help out at home, right?

829
01:00:09,240 --> 01:00:10,040
Jane...

830
01:00:12,920 --> 01:00:13,920
I'm sorry.

831
01:00:18,000 --> 01:00:20,320
I finally understand what you used to tell me.

832
01:00:22,520 --> 01:00:23,560
A dream...

833
01:00:25,080 --> 01:00:26,000
if it comes too easily,

834
01:00:26,000 --> 01:00:27,680
it holds no value at all.

835
01:00:29,720 --> 01:00:31,360
You were right all along.

836
01:00:33,920 --> 01:00:35,000
It's my fault

837
01:00:36,480 --> 01:00:38,440
for giving Jet his dream so easily.

838
01:00:40,920 --> 01:00:42,680
That's why Jet couldn't hold onto it.

839
01:00:49,760 --> 01:00:52,280
Even though I didn't ask for anything in return,

840
01:00:54,960 --> 01:00:56,080
in the end,

841
01:00:57,280 --> 01:00:58,880
Jet still had to pay the price for a dream

842
01:00:58,880 --> 01:01:00,760
that came too easily anyway.

843
01:01:03,320 --> 01:01:04,360
And it ended up causing trouble

844
01:01:04,360 --> 01:01:06,040
for your family as well.

845
01:01:20,880 --> 01:01:22,000
I'm begging you...

846
01:01:25,040 --> 01:01:26,680
please let me make amends.

847
01:01:29,600 --> 01:01:32,480
Please accept your family's house back, Jane.

848
01:01:38,320 --> 01:01:39,560
I know now

849
01:01:41,160 --> 01:01:43,000
that you are truly sorry.

850
01:01:47,320 --> 01:01:49,320
But I really can't accept it.

851
01:01:58,720 --> 01:01:59,560
Why?

852
01:02:00,240 --> 01:02:01,400
I don't understand.

853
01:02:03,400 --> 01:02:05,520
Why won't you let me help you?

854
01:02:06,000 --> 01:02:07,920
We are lovers, aren't we?

855
01:02:14,880 --> 01:02:16,080
I really don't get it.

856
01:02:19,040 --> 01:02:21,320
So many other people come asking me for help,

857
01:02:25,680 --> 01:02:26,720
yet you..

858
01:02:29,320 --> 01:02:31,800
the person I love, refuse to let me help.

859
01:02:42,400 --> 01:02:43,920
Because I love you,

860
01:02:45,600 --> 01:02:46,960
that's why I have to prove

861
01:02:48,480 --> 01:02:51,000
that I am worthy of being your lover,

862
01:02:51,960 --> 01:02:53,280
unlike everyone else

863
01:02:54,680 --> 01:02:56,880
who approaches you with other motives.

864
01:03:18,520 --> 01:03:20,520
Please give me some time, P'Jane.

